// <cmath> for Quantum's native backend. sqrt, fabs, floor, ceil and trunc
// are built in (SSE instructions, exact); the rest are Windows' own C
// runtime (ucrtbase.dll) — the very functions a g++ (UCRT) build calls, so
// results agree to the last bit.
